# Master Rules (caveman)

- This file = entrypoint.
- `laravel-boost.mdc` = main law.
- Other files = context law by file type.

- Always:
  - Chat in Italian.
  - Code/docs comments in English.
  - Run `vendor/bin/pint --dirty` before finish.
  - Every code change must have tests.

- Rule map:
  - `01-php-laravel-standards.mdc` PHP/Blade.
  - `02-architecture-patterns.mdc` controllers/services/models/repos.
  - `03-performance-optimization.mdc` models/services/jobs/migrations.
  - `04-error-handling-security.mdc` controller/middleware/exception/request.
  - `05-testing-development.mdc` tests and Pest.
  - `06-coding-principles.mdc` always-on coding principles.
  - `07-laraplate-specific.mdc` module architecture rules.
